data: {"id": "60e5dfdb00ad49da-thinking-parallel_evidence-2601", "run_id": "60e5dfdb00ad49da", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到以下关键事实：\n\n- **生命周期状态**：Pod `workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8` (UID: `08e11260-3505-495c-8224-2b91f27f029c`) 当前 `phase: Running`，但 `Ready: False`。容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，`Reason: CrashLoopBackOff`。`restarts: 5`，退出码 `exitCode: 2`。这与 CrashLoopBackOff 候选一致。\n- **直接原因证据**：`kubectl_describe` 显示 Last State 为 `Terminated`，`Reason: Error`，`Exit Code: 2`。`kubectl_previous_logs` 返回了一条明确的错误日志：`\"event\": \"http_request\", \"level\": \"error\", \"message\": \"runtime process exiting\", \"http_status\": 500, \"path\": \"/work\"`。这表", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789065405880, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

